  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Rural Entrepreneurship, Investment and Trade in Papua New Guinea (STREIT PNG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the Programme is to increase sustainable and inclusive economic development of rural areas. The specific objectives (SO) of the action are:
SO1: Increased economic return from three selected value chains in the selected regions.
SO2: Strengthened, climate resilient and more efficient value chain enablers.</narrative>
  </description>
